mg src=\"https://imgur.com/pcmP0xG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\"><br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VYJzkYE.png\" width=\"51\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sKvQO1d.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「No Enchantment Cap Level」移除了由 Minecraft 開發者設定的附魔等級限制，現在上限 255 已提升至&nbsp;2147483647（整數上限），並且您可以使用負數等級，例如 -1、-100、-10000000。現在您可以透過新指令 /setenchant 將任何附魔套用至任何物品上，請查看 Wiki 以了解使用方法。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xAPPVoI.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/eIRCTYW.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p><em><strong>常見問題</strong></em><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Q：我能否將 No Enchantment Cap Level 納入我的模組整合包中？</strong><br>A：當然可以，只需將我的模組列入相關專案即可。</span></p>\n<p><strong>Q：/setenchant 指令是否對非管理員玩家生效？</strong><br>A：不會，您必須擁有管理員權限才能使用該指令。</p>",
